The port is a derivative work of ELK. The files in this directory tree are
made available under the Eclipse Public License 2.0. Each ported file names
the ELK source file that it was ported from. The package gwt ports the parts
of the Java runtime emulation of the GWT project (https://www.gwtproject.org,
Apache License 2.0) that decide the results of elkjs. The file prop/enum.go
ports java.util.EnumSet of the same runtime.

The conditions of the Apache License 2.0 stay in force for the code that is
ported from GWT. The file gwt/NOTICE has the notices of that code, and the
file gwt/LICENSE-GWT.txt has the Apache License 2.0.

The phase goldens in nativetest/testdata are records of the behavior of
elkjs 0.9.3 (https://github.com/kieler/elkjs, EPL-2.0).
